<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-135-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.526934" lon="-121.10325"><name>SC26-135-C</name><cmt>SC26-135</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 3.8 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 28/100; not catch probability. Center 133 ft; nearby 119–141 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 504 m from screened closed/access-restricted area; plan entire drift clear. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt></gpx>
